  "contentHtml": "<P>흡수스펙트럼을 분석하여 우주의 팽창의 설명하는데요.</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>흡수스펙트럼은 <!--StartFragment--></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">빛이 저온</SPAN><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">의 기체를 통과할 때 보이는 검은 색의 띠 라고 합니다.</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">1. 지구까지 빛이 오는데 저온의 기체는 우주 어디에 있나요?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">2. 적색 편이 현상은 은하의 흡수 스펙트럼을 수분 동안 관찰하는지요?</SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 아니면 수년, 수십년? </SPAN></P>\r\n<P class=0 style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><SPAN style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"></SPAN>&nbsp;</P>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
